{"text":"I have always maintained the conviction that my country and people are so much better than our recent history indicates. I have come to appreciate its difficult moments, but I believe I'm a better leader, a better person with a richer appreciation for the present because of my resilient past. For graduates of 2011, the size of your dreams must always exceed your current capacity to achieve them. If your dreams do not scare you, they are not big enough. If you start off with a small dream, you may not have much left when it is fulfilled because along the way, life will task your dreams and make demands on you. I am however bullish about the future of our world because of everyone in this yard, because of those who have graduated today. Fear the next for the future.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":1.34},{"text":"have","start":1.34,"end":1.48},{"text":"always","start":1.48,"end":1.82},{"text":"maintained","start":1.82,"end":2.24},{"text":"the","start":2.24,"end":2.42},{"text":"conviction","start":2.42,"end":2.9},{"text":"that","start":2.9,"end":4.48},{"text":"my","start":4.48,"end":4.66},{"text":"country","start":4.66,"end":5.16},{"text":"and","start":5.16,"end":6.62},{"text":"people","start":6.62,"end":7.08},{"text":"are","start":7.08,"end":8.26},{"text":"so","start":8.26,"end":8.54},{"text":"much","start":8.54,"end":8.74},{"text":"better","start":8.74,"end":9.02},{"text":"than","start":9.02,"end":9.26},{"text":"our","start":9.26,"end":9.44},{"text":"recent","start":9.44,"end":9.86},{"text":"history","start":9.86,"end":10.3},{"text":"indicates","start":10.3,"end":10.8,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":12.12,"end":12.46},{"text":"have","start":12.46,"end":12.58},{"text":"come","start":12.58,"end":12.8},{"text":"to","start":12.8,"end":13.0},{"text":"appreciate","start":13.0,"end":13.5},{"text":"its","start":13.5,"end":14.3},{"text":"difficult","start":14.3,"end":14.7},{"text":"moments","start":14.7,"end":15.26,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":16.18,"en